    {
      "text": "instruct and edify each other, D&C 43:8 (88:122; 107:85). he that preaches and he that receives understand each other and are edified, D&C 50:22. that which does not edify is not of God, D&C 50:23. he whose language is meek and edifies is of God, D&C 52:16. strong in spirit should edify weak in meekness, D&C 84:106. body needs every member, that all may be edified together, D&C 84:110. house of the Lord is tabernacle of the Holy Spirit to Saints’ edification, D&C 88:137. let words edify one another, D&C 136:24.",
